ow. Change nothing else in the file. Verify: `rg -c \"the locale and XDG prefixes\" $RA` prints 1, `rg -c \"no other credential\" $RA` prints nothing, `rg -c \"attached to each published row\" $RA` prints 1, `rg -c \"capturedAtSha\" $RA` prints at least 1, `rg -c \"intent buckets and unknown count\" $RA` prints 1 and ``rg -c '^\\| `[^`]+\\.(mjs|py|jsonl|json)` \\|' $RA`` prints 21.\n174: <!-- /ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n175: \n176: ---\n177: \n178: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n179: ## Phase 3: Verification\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 180]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/014-review-remediation/tasks.md\", \"offset\": 160, \"limit\": 20}"},"time":{"start":1794561537987,"end":1794561538042}}}}
