{"type":"text","timestamp":1794561767557,"sessionID":"ses_e2bccab67ffeeMpZcEzAjOQu4l","part":{"id":"prt_1d4376853001dKL3cpg6TCjhv1","sessionID":"ses_e2bccab67ffeeMpZcEzAjOQu4l","messageID":"msg_1d437534c001Fz3SWwueyHeh0g","type":"text","text":"T068 is complete. Here is the report.\n\n## Files written\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` — added `symlinkSync` to the `node:fs` import, `fileURLToPath` from `node:url`, and a new `describe('entry guard', ...)` with one case that links `runner.mjs` → `R` and `scorer.mjs` → `S` in a `mkdtempSync` folder, runs both through the links with `spawnSync`, and removes the folder in `finally`.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs` — `invokedDirectly` now compares `realpathSync(process.argv[1])` with `realpathSync(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url))` in a `try`/`catch`, and the comment gained the sentence about resolving links.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` — same guard, plus `realpathSync` added to the `node:fs` import.\n\nNo other files were touched. I did not tick the checkbox.\n\n## Verify output\n\nBefore the fix, with the new case present:\n\n```\n ❯ tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts (6 tests | 1 failed) 171ms\n     × runs the CLI when it is launched through a symlink 43ms\nAssertionError: expected '' to be 'g2-deep-research-ask'\n Test Files  1 failed (1)\n      Tests  1 failed | 5 passed (6)\n```\n\nAfter the fix (`env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` in `ADV`):\n\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  6 passed (6)\n```\n\nSyntax checks:\n\n```\nnode --check .../run-command-behaviour.mjs      -> R exit=0\nnode --check .../score-command-transcripts.mjs  -> S exit=0\n```\n\n`G2SUM`:\n\n```\n{\"claude\":\"3 of 6\",\"codex\":\"0 of 6\",\"devin\":\"4 of 6\",\"dsh\":\"3 of 4\",\"opencode\":\"5 of 6\",\"pi\":\"4 of 6\"}\n```\n\nManual symlink checks (temporary `mktemp -d`, both links, then `rm -rf`):\n\n```\nrunner first line: g2-deep-research-ask\nscorer no args exit: 2\nscorer stderr: score-command-transcripts.mjs: --runtime is required with --locator\nscorer summary: {\"claude\":\"3 of 6\",\"codex\":\"0 of 6\",\"devin\":\"4 of 6\",\"dsh\":\"3 of 4\",\"opencode\":\"5 of 6\",\"pi\":\"4 of 6\"}\ncleaned: yes\n```\n\nNo temp files remain. The two scripts show additional uncommitted hunks from earlier Wave 4 tasks in the same lane (exports, allowlist, arena refusal); I left them untouched. Nothing in this task could not be done.","time":{"start":1794561763411,"end":1794561767557}}}
